## Motion Defaults
- Trigger: start when the text top reaches `82%` of the viewport.
- Duration: `0.7s` to `0.9s`.
- Stagger: `0.025s` to `0.045s` per word.
- Offset: `yPercent: 110` to `0`.
- Ease: `power3.out` or `expo.out`.
- Replay: reveal once by default.

